  "title": "Norway: First CO2 storage in Northern Lights",
  "summary": "Paris, August 25, 2025 – TotalEnergies and its partners, Equinor and Shell, announce that the first CO2 volumes were successfully transported by vessel from Heidelberg Materials’ cement factory in Brevik, Norway to Northern Lights’ facilities in Øygarden. They were then injected 2,600 meters below the seabed into the storage facilities, 100 km off the coast of Western Norway. Northern […]",
